<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= siteSettings.site_name %> — Cloud Hosting</title><meta name="description" content="Premium cloud hosting powered by <%= siteSettings.site_name %>."><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="<%= siteSettings.site_logo %>"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/billore-theme.css"><% if (siteSettings.background_image) { %><style>:root{--site-bg-image:url('<%= siteSettings.background_image %>')}</style><% } %></head><body><%- include('partials/menu') %><main><section class="bc-hero"><div class="hero-glow"></div><div class="hero-content"><div class="eyebrow">POWERED BY <%= siteSettings.site_name.toUpperCase() %></div><h1>Reliable hosting.<br><span>Built for your next project.</span></h1><p>Explore our live hosting catalog. Categories and products published from the Admin Dashboard appear here automatically.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="bc-btn" href="#categories">Explore Hosting <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><% if (currentUser) { %><a class="bc-btn bc-btn-ghost" href="/panel">Open Client Panel</a><% } else { %><a class="bc-btn bc-btn-ghost" href="/register">Create Account</a><% } %></div></div><div class="hero-card"><div class="status-dot"></div><div><strong>Cloud Infrastructure</strong><small>Fast • Secure • Reliable</small></div><div class="hero-stat"><b>24/7</b><small>Support</small></div></div></section><section class="bc-section" id="categories"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">LIVE CATALOG</div><h2>Choose your <span>category.</span></h2><p class="muted">Only categories created and enabled from the Admin Dashboard are shown.</p></div></div><% if (categories && categories.length) { %><div class="catalog-category-grid"><% categories.forEach(function(c,index){ %><a class="bc-card catalog-category-card reveal-card" style="--reveal-delay:<%= Math.min(index*70,420) %>ms" href="/category/<%= encodeURIComponent(String(c.id)) %>"><div class="catalog-category-image"><% if(c.image){ %><img src="<%= c.image %>" alt="<%= c.name %>" loading="lazy"><% }else{ %><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i><% } %></div><div class="catalog-category-content"><h3><%= c.name %></h3><p><%= c.description || 'View available products in this category.' %></p><span>View Products <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></span></div></a><% }) %></div><% }else{ %><div class="bc-card catalog-empty"><div class="catalog-empty-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i></div><h3>Hosting categories are coming soon</h3><p class="muted">The admin can publish categories and products from the Admin Dashboard.</p><a class="bc-btn" href="/admin/login">Admin Login</a></div><% } %></section><section class="bc-section feature-row"><div class="bc-card feature-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i><h3>Fast Infrastructure</h3><p>Modern hosting infrastructure for dependable performance.</p></div><div class="bc-card feature-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i><h3>Secure by Design</h3><p>Your client account and services stay protected.</p></div><div class="bc-card feature-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i><h3>Support</h3><p>Get help whenever you need it through our support channel.</p></div></section></main></body></html>
